## 四、通用条款 / Article 4 — General Terms

**4.1 无其他授权 / No Other Rights.** 除本协议明示授予者外，不授予任何明示或默示的权利（包括专利权、商标权的任何许可）。 No rights are granted other than those expressly stated herein (including any license of patent or trademark rights).

**4.2 无担保 / No Warranty.** 本作品按"现状"提供，不作任何明示或默示担保，包括但不限于对适销性、特定用途适用性及不侵权的担保。 The Work is provided "as is" without any express or implied warranty, including any warranty of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.

**4.3 责任限制 / Limitation of Liability.** 无论何种情形，权利人对因使用或不能使用本作品所致的任何间接、特殊、附带或后果性损害不承担责任。 In no event shall the Rights Holder be liable for any indirect, special, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use or inability to use the Work.

**4.4 终止 / Termination.** 任何主体若违反本协议，其获得的所有许可自违反之日起自动终止；终止后须立即停止使用并销毁所有副本。 Any breach automatically terminates all licenses granted; upon termination, use must cease and all copies destroyed.

**4.5 商标 / Trademarks.** 本协议不授予任何商标使用权。"Nohn""第二视角"等标识的 ™/® 权利均归相关权利人所有。 No trademark rights are granted; the ™/® marks such as "Nohn" and "Second Perspective" belong to their respective owners.

**4.6 适用法律与管辖 / Governing Law and Jurisdiction.** 依第二条（许可人确定与适用法律）之约定确定。 As determined by Article 2.

**4.7 可分割性 / Severability.** 任一条款被认定无效，不影响其余条款效力。 If any provision is held invalid, the remainder of this Agreement remains effective.

**4.8 完整协议 / Entire Agreement.** 本协议构成双方就本作品授权的完整约定，取代此前所有口头或书面沟通。 This Agreement is the entire understanding between the parties regarding the authorization of the Work and supersedes all prior oral or written communications.

## 五、虚拟世界与运行时附加条款 / Article 5 — Virtual-World and Runtime Supplementary Terms

**5.1 适用范围界定 / Scope of Coverage.** 第一条至第四条规范"本作品"在**软件层面**的获取、使用、修改与分发。本作品作为虚拟世界 / 元宇宙基础设施基座运行时所提供的**在线服务、账户体系与运营行为**不在本协议的授权范围内，须另行取得授权并遵守适用法律。 Articles 1–4 govern the acquisition, use, modification, and distribution of the Work **at the software layer**. The **online services, account systems, and operations** offered when the Work runs as a virtual-world / metaverse infrastructure base are outside the scope of this Agreement and require separate authorization and compliance with applicable law.

**5.2 公开实例的部署条件 / Conditions for Public Instances.** 任何向第三方（包括但不限于玩家、研究者、合作伙伴或公众）开放的运行实例，**无论是否收取费用**，均构成运营行为，须事先取得权利人书面授权；获授权者应在其服务界面公示其玩家服务协议与申诉渠道。 Any running instance open to third parties (including but not limited to players, researchers, partners, or the public), **whether or not a fee is charged**, constitutes an operation and requires prior written authorization; the authorized party shall publish its player service agreement and complaint channel in its service interface.

**5.3 用户生成内容与虚拟资产 / User-Generated Content and Virtual Assets.** 玩家在世界内创作的文本、图像、建筑、命名及其他内容，其著作权归**创作者**所有；运营方仅取得为提供与维护该服务所必需的非独占、可撤销、免许可费的使用许可。世界内资产的权属记录采用内容寻址与链上锚定，**服务终止不影响该权属记录的独立存在**。 Copyright in content created by players — text, images, structures, naming, and other works — belongs to the **creator**; the operator receives only a non-exclusive, revocable, royalty-free license necessary to provide and maintain the service. Ownership records of in-world assets use content addressing and on-chain anchoring; **termination of the service does not extinguish the independent existence of those records**.

**5.4 运行时数据 / Runtime Data.** 运行时产生的世界状态、账本与审计记录，其权属与合规责任由**运营方**承担。运营方应依其适用的个人信息保护法律（包括但不限于《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》及欧盟《通用数据保护条例》）履行告知、最小化、留存与删除义务。审计记录可含主张与假设的**结构**，不含原始敏感输入（该设计见证书 `input_digest` 字段）。 Ownership of and compliance responsibility for runtime world state, ledgers, and audit records rest with the **operator**, who shall fulfil notice, minimisation, retention, and deletion obligations under applicable personal-information law (including the PRC Personal Information Protection Law and the EU GDPR). Audit records may contain the **structure** of claims and assumptions, not the raw sensitive inputs (see the certificate `input_digest` field).

**5.5 治理决议的效力顺位 / Priority of Governance Decisions.** 世界内的公投、治理或共识机制决议**不得**变更、豁免或扩张本协议项下的授权条款；许可条款的效力**高于**治理决议。 Decisions of in-world referendum, governance, or consensus mechanisms shall **not** amend, waive, or expand the license terms; the license terms **prevail over** governance decisions.

**5.6 第三方组件与素材 / Third-Party Components and Assets.** 本作品可能包含或依赖第三方组件与素材（例如 npm 包 `docx`，依 MIT 许可提供）；该等组件与素材依其各自许可条款提供，其权利归各自权利人所有。 The Work may contain or depend on third-party components and assets (for example the npm package `docx`, provided under the MIT licence); such components are provided under their own terms and their rights belong to their respective owners.

**5.7 玩家服务协议最低要件 / Minimum Requirements for a Player Service Agreement.** 依 5.2 获授权运营公开实例者，其玩家服务协议至少应包含：① 账户与身份；② 行为准则与违规处置；③ 虚拟资产的归属、使用与转让规则；④ 个人信息处理与删除；⑤ 服务变更、中断与终止；⑥ 适用法律与争议解决。**缺少上述要件的，视为未满足 5.2 的授权条件。** An authorized operator of a public instance under 5.2 shall include in its player service agreement at least: (i) accounts and identity; (ii) code of conduct and enforcement; (iii) rules for ownership, use, and transfer of virtual assets; (iv) personal-information processing and deletion; (v) service modification, suspension, and termination; (vi) governing law and dispute resolution. **Absence of these elements means the conditions of 5.2 are not met.**

